",{"children":"*\"After using OfferGoose, my interview confidence and communication skills skyrocketed like a rocket.\"*"}]]}],["$","p","2",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"— Xiaohongshu user review, 12K likes"}]]}]]}],["$","blockquote","341",{"style":{"borderLeft":"4px solid #22d3ee","paddingLeft":"24px","margin":"24px 0","fontStyle":"italic","color":"#a3a3a3"},"children":[["$","p","0",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"\"系统会结合个人履历，有针对性地进行调整，目前已有不少人采纳AI建议调整简历，并收到心仪单位的录用通知。\""}]]}],["$","p","1",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"*\"The system adjusts based on individual experience, and many students have already adopted AI suggestions to refine their resumes and received offers from target employers.\"*"}]]}],["$","p","2",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"— Jiangsu 24365 Platform Operations Team"}]]}]]}],["$","hr","342",{"style":{"border":"none","borderTop":"1px solid #1a1a1a","margin":"32px 0"}}],["$","h2","344",{"style":{"fontSize":"28px","fontWeight":"600","margin":"40px 0 20px","color":"#f5f5f5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Conclusion"}]]}],["$","p","346",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"AI interview coaching has evolved from a fringe productivity tool to a "}],["$","strong","1",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"mainstream survival mechanism"}],["$","span","2",{"children":" for Chinese graduates navigating the most competitive job market in the nation's history. The numbers tell the story: 180 million Xiaohongshu views, 12 million platform users, 340+ university adoption programs, and a 120% weekly growth rate that shows no signs of slowing."}]]}],["$","p","348",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"chi